-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">যে</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">সকল</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">কাজের</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">মাধ্যমে</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">উপার্জন</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">করতে</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">পারব</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">তার</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">মধ্যে</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">অন্যতম</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">হলোঃ</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">১।</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">স্টডিওতে</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">ছবি</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">এডিটিং</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\