(133, 51, '---------------------------------------বিস্তারিত----------------------------------------', '1', 'Only Text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1. <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বিক্রয়</span>:\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আপনার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবসায়ে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কি</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরিমাণে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রোডাক্ট</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বিক্রয়</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span>, <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সেটাপ</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাহায্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যেন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আপনি</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">স্টক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অপ্টিমাইজ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পারেন।</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">স্টক</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ম্যানেজমেন্ট</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সফটওয়্যার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাথে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&qu