;,sans-serif\">দিয়ে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আপনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আপনার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খরচের</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নিরীক্ষণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পারেন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এবং</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">স্টক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ম্যানেজ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাহায্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে।</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4. <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গ্রাহকের</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ডেটাবেস</span>: <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আপনার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গ্রাহকের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তথ্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নির্ধারণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করতে</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাহায্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গ্রাহকের</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরিচিতি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বৃদ্ধি</span> <span st