quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">💪 Key Strengths:</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Cross-Platform Development: Proficient in building elegant and responsive applications for both iOS and Android using a single codebase.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">UI/UX Design: Adept at creating visually appealing and intuitive interfaces, prioritizing a seamless and enjoyable user experience.</span><br></p>', 'Full Time', '2019-05-05', 1, NULL, 1, '2023-12-13 04:59:54', '2023-12-13 04:59:54'),
(3, 10, '<p style=\"margin-top:0in;line-height:80%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">I am a professional Web Application\r\nDeveloper and a self-employed hardworking person. Programming is my true\r\npassion, and I thoroughly enjoy researching new technologies and solving\r\ncomplex problems through coding.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; line-height: 80%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Cambria Math&quot;, serif;\">◼</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">Specialists:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; line-height: 80%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">##Frontend<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; line-height: 80%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, sans-serif;\">➡</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">JavaScript, JQuery.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; line-height: 80%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, sans-serif;\">➡</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">Bootstrap, CSS, HTML.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; line-height: 80%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">##Backend<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;line-height:80%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, sans-serif;\">➡</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">Laravel, Codeigniter, Php, Livewire.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0in;line-height:80%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\">##Database<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0in; line-height: 80%;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, sans-serif;\">➡</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Narrow&quot;, sans-serif;\"> MySQL, SQL, Database design.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', 'Full Time', '2019-05-05', 1, NULL, 1, '2023-12-13 22:12:26', '2023-12-13 22:21:23'),
(4, 19, '<p>Experienced Full-Stack Developer with a strong grasp of PHP, Laravel, Livewire, MySQL, Vue.js, Nuxt.js, jQuery, and Git. Skilled in developing, testing, deploying, and maintaining high-performance web applications. Known for optimizing web application performance and adeptly troubleshooting technical issues. With expertise in live server deployment, I ensure a seamless shift from development to a reliable and efficient production environment.</p>', 'Full Time', '2021-01-01', 0, '2024-03-31', 1, '2024-02-03 05:12:12', '2025-07-31 15:27:54');
